{#
  SITE FOOTER — Figma 275:57838. The last section on the page.

  REPLACES THE v2 EXPANDING CONTACT CARD that stood here. That was one element
  with two states, driven by initFooterContact() in scripts/app.js and a
  fixed-height scroll runway; the comp has neither. The JS guards on
  #footer-stage / #footer-cta and returns at its first line now that those ids
  are gone, so it degrades without an edit — deleting it belongs to the sweep
  that removes the rest of the v2 leftovers, not here.

  #contact LIVES ON THIS ELEMENT. It is what every "Contact" link in the header
  has pointed at since the redesign started, and until now it resolved to
  nothing on the homepage — scripts/header-theme.js skips links whose target is
  missing, so the header's Contact item has never been able to show its selected
  state. It can from here on, with no change to that script: it was written to
  observe whichever targets actually exist.

  data-header-theme="dark" for the same reason .work carries it — the header
  passes over this band and has to invert while it does.

  THE THREE COLUMNS ARE NOT THREE HARDCODED LISTS. Case studies is
  collections.workCards, so the footer cannot list a different three than the My
  Work section; Get in touch is site.contactPrimary, the same array the old
  footer's collapsed row used. Only More works is footer-specific data.

  A LINK OR PLAIN TEXT, per item. Medium appears in the comp but no Medium
  account exists in site.js, so its url is null and it renders as a <span>.
  button.njk's habit of degrading a missing href to a dead <button> is exactly
  what is being avoided — a menu item that looks live and goes nowhere is worse
  than one that plainly is not a link.
#}

<footer class="site-footer" id="contact" data-header-theme="dark">
  <div class="site-footer__inner">
    <div class="site-footer__row">

      {# Left half: the sign-off at the top, the copyright pinned to the bottom.
         The comp's `justify-between` over a full-height column is what puts the
         copyright on the baseline of the tallest link column rather than a
         fixed distance below the tagline. #}
      <div class="site-footer__intro">
        <div class="site-footer__intro-text">
          <h2 class="site-footer__heading">{{ site.footer.heading }}</h2>
          <p class="site-footer__tagline">{{ site.footer.tagline }}</p>
        </div>

        <p class="site-footer__copyright">
          <span>&copy; {{ site.copyrightYear }},</span>
          <span>{{ site.footer.siteName }}</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      {# Right half: three equal columns. #}
      <div class="site-footer__columns">

        <nav class="site-footer__column" aria-label="{{ site.footer.titles.caseStudies }}">
          <h3 class="site-footer__column-title">{{ site.footer.titles.caseStudies }}</h3>
          <ul class="site-footer__list">
            {%- for p in collections.workCards %}
              <li>
                {%- if p.url %}
                  <a class="site-footer__item" href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.title }}</a>
                {%- else %}
                  <span class="site-footer__item">{{ p.title }}</span>
                {%- endif %}
              </li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <nav class="site-footer__column" aria-label="{{ site.footer.titles.moreWorks }}">
          <h3 class="site-footer__column-title">{{ site.footer.titles.moreWorks }}</h3>
          <ul class="site-footer__list">
            {%- for l in site.footer.moreWorks %}
              <li>
                {%- if l.url %}
                  <a
                    class="site-footer__item"
                    href="{{ l.url }}"
                    {%- if l.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
                  >{{ l.name }}</a>
                {%- else %}
                  <span class="site-footer__item">{{ l.name }}</span>
                {%- endif %}
              </li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <nav class="site-footer__column" aria-label="{{ site.footer.titles.getInTouch }}">
          <h3 class="site-footer__column-title">{{ site.footer.titles.getInTouch }}</h3>
          <ul class="site-footer__list">
            {%- for l in site.contactPrimary %}
              <li>
                <a
                  class="site-footer__item"
                  href="{{ l.url }}"
                  {%- if l.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
                >{{ l.name }}</a>
              </li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </nav>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
